SDiT release preparation

This distribution contains the authors' SDiT research implementation built on
Microsoft RAS and Hugging Face Diffusers. The `ras` namespace is retained for
compatibility and does not identify this package as an upstream RAS release.

* Microsoft RAS: https://github.com/microsoft/RAS
  MIT notice: licenses/RAS-MIT.txt. Existing copyright notices are retained.
* Hugging Face Diffusers: https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers
  Files carrying Apache-2.0 headers remain under Apache-2.0;
  license text: licenses/Apache-2.0.txt. Locally adapted schedulers, transformer
  forwards and attention processors implement region scheduling and caching.
New release interface, documentation and tests use the root MIT license.
The root license does not replace the licenses of third-party-derived files,
model weights, or datasets. Model weights and datasets are not redistributed.

The source manifest records retained engine files and release modifications.
This release aligns clean-latent partitioning, refresh scores, prediction reuse
and geometric anchor selection with the current manuscript. Experimental
attention extensions and unsupported model adapters are excluded. See
docs/implementation.md and docs/validation.md for the policy and checks.
